{"id":"a51ee3da02896b94","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Morass Fragment","display":"df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment — ZFC Inner3 Morass Fragment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment — ZFC Inner3 Morass Fragment","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment — ZFC Inner3 Morass Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"952d622641f51ebe\" href=\"?note=952d622641f51ebe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure\">58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (fragment length and code, ambient length and code, and their components).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S\\)</span> (source predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"952d622641f51ebe\" href=\"?note=952d622641f51ebe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure\">58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}morass\\text{-}fragment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land D_\\kappa=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\kappa+1)^2:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\left\\langle\n\\Theta\\upharpoonright(\\kappa+1),\nF\\upharpoonright D_\\kappa\n\\right\\rangle\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}morass\\text{-}fragment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\land D_\\kappa=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\kappa+1)^2:\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\}\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\left\\langle\n\\Theta\\upharpoonright(\\kappa+1),\nF\\upharpoonright D_\\kappa\n\\right\\rangle\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A morass is an ordered pair of a level function and a transition-family function, not a single function.  The two components are therefore restricted on their actual domains separately.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure","status":"resolved","id":"952d622641f51ebe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the ordinal predicate from [[58-df-ordinal]].","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure","status":"resolved","id":"952d622641f51ebe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S$ (source predicate; see [[58-df-zfc-large-morass-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\mathcal M,\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}morass\\text{-}fragment}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3MorassFragment}_S(\\kappa,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\exists\\theta,\\mathcal N,\\Theta,F,D_\\kappa\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\theta)\\land\\kappa\\leq\\theta\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcLargeMorassStructure}_S(\\mathcal N,\\theta)\n\\land\\mathcal N=\\langle\\Theta,F\\rangle\\\\\n&\\land D_\\kappa=\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in(\\kappa+1)^2:\\alpha<\\beta\\}\n\\land\\mathcal M=\\left\\langle\n\\Theta\\upharpoonright(\\kappa+1),\nF\\upharpoonright D_\\kappa\n\\right\\rangle\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1569,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2371","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment.md|58-df-zfc-inner3-morass-fragment]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","952d622641f51ebe"]}